## B.2 Data model

### ERD (Mermaid)

```mermaid
erDiagram
  USER ||--o{ SESSION : has
  USER ||--o{ REFRESH_TOKEN : owns
  SESSION ||--|| ACCESS_TOKEN : contains

  USER {
    uuid id PK
    string email UK
    timestamp created_at
  }
  SESSION {
    uuid id PK
    uuid user_id FK
    timestamp expires_at
  }
  REFRESH_TOKEN {
    uuid id PK
    uuid user_id FK
    string token_hash
    timestamp expires_at
    bool revoked
  }
```

