# D. Implementation guidance

## D.1 File structure proposal

```
<target_repo>/
├── apps/
│   └── <service-name>/
│       ├── src/
│       │   ├── routes/        # FastAPI routers (1 per resource)
│       │   ├── services/      # business logic
│       │   ├── models/        # Pydantic + SQLAlchemy
│       │   ├── adapters/      # external integrations
│       │   └── tests/
│       │       ├── unit/
│       │       ├── integration/
│       │       └── e2e/
│       ├── api/
│       │   └── openapi.yaml   # spec-versioned with code
│       ├── docs/
│       │   ├── security/      # STRIDE, threat models
│       │   └── adr/           # Architecture Decision Records
│       └── pyproject.toml
└── packages/
    └── <generated-client>/    # SDK generated from openapi.yaml
```

## D.2 Naming conventions

- **Python:** `snake_case.py`, `PascalCase` classes, `snake_case` functions,
  `SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE` constants, formatter = Ruff + Black
- **TypeScript:** `PascalCase.tsx` for components, `camelCase.ts` for utils,
  `useCamelCase` hooks, formatter = Prettier + ESLint
- **Database:** `snake_case` tables (plural), `snake_case` columns,
  `<table>_id` for FKs
- **API:** `/v1/<resource>/<id>` (RESTful), RFC 7807 error format

